---
import { site } from "../config";
---

<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-8 bg-paper-deep pb-16 pt-20 lg:pb-20 lg:pt-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,2.75rem)] font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.015em]"
      >
        About me
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        <p>
          I'm Tristan Barrow. I've been building software for over a decade and
          I've been coaching and consulting for half of that. I'm a true
          programmer's programmer who's been using Vim for 8 years.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've intentionally tried to dabble in everything related to computers
          so I can have a high-level understanding of the stack from bottom to
          top. I've built processors from transistors. I've built assembly
          languages to run on those processors. I've written compilers to
          compile high-level languages down to assembly, and much more.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've spent thousands of hours in the last 5 years trying to answer a
          single question. How do I make dev teams go fast without breaking
          things? It's a complicated enough question that there isn't a single,
          simple and satisfying answer, but I understand the problem and how to
          iterate a company towards its own solution.
        </p>
      </div>
      {/* TODO: add a scan of your real signature here (an SVG or transparent PNG). */}
    </div>

    <!-- The page's closing ask, set as a full-width ruled row. -->
    <div
      id="book"
      class="mt-16 flex scroll-mt-8 flex-col gap-6 border-t-2 border-ink pt-8 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium">
          Book a free 60-minute introduction session
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-soft">
          Tell me what you're building and where you're stuck. Or email{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="link">{site.email}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href={site.bookingUrl} class="btn shrink-0">Choose a time</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
